  m_text: "The aim of this project is to bring SgSL to be easier to learn using a
    desktop camera and AI. This will make learning SgSL more accessible to people
    who are willing to learn without paying. \n\nSgSL (Singapore Sign Language) is
    the most well-used sign language in Singapore, with the Deaf community using
    it to communicate with their peers. "
